      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Analyze the following email and classify it.\n\nSubject: {{ $json.Subject }}\nBody: {{ $json.snippet }}\n\nReturn the category, priority, sentiment, department, and a one-line summary.\n\nCategory rules:\n- Sales, Support, Complaint, Invoice: use when the email clearly matches that intent.\n- Spam: use ONLY for recognizable unsolicited promotional, marketing, scam, or phishing messages written in coherent language.\n- General: use for a coherent, legitimate email that does not fit the more specific categories above.\n- Unknown: you MUST use this when the Subject and Body are gibberish, random characters, empty, corrupted, not real human language, or otherwise carry no meaningful content. Do NOT force such content into Spam or General. If you cannot understand what the email is actually about, the category is Unknown.\n\nRespond with ONLY a single valid JSON object (no markdown fences, no extra text) with keys: category, priority, sentiment, department, summary.",
